Today's date: 9/27/2026

AVAILABLE TOOLS
1. search_library: {"query": "the deadline in the vendor contract"} → passages from the user's own documents
2. search_web: {"query": "your search query"} → a list of web results
3. read_url: {"url": "https://example.com"} → the full text of a page
4. browser_navigate: {"url": "https://example.com"} → opens a stateful browser session
5. browser_get_elements: {} → indexed clickable elements, links and inputs
6. browser_click: {"index": 0} → clicks the element at that index
7. browser_type: {"index": 0, "text": "hello"} → types into that input
8. browser_press_key: {"key": "Enter"} → presses a key
9. browser_get_text: {} → the text of the current browser page
10. browser_close: {} → closes the browser session
